<style>
  .panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 2;
    padding-bottom: 2;
    padding-left: 3;
    padding-right: 3;
    background-color: rgba(0, 10, 30, 0.92);
    border-color: #00ffff;
    border-width: 0.15;
    border-radius: 1.5;
    gap: 1;
  }
  .heading {
    font-size: 3;
    color: #00ffff;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section {
    font-size: 1.8;
    color: #ffaa00;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .text {
    font-size: 1.2;
    color: #aabbcc;
  }
  .back-btn {
    padding-top: 0.6;
    padding-bottom: 0.6;
    padding-left: 2;
    padding-right: 2;
    background-color: rgba(100, 100, 100, 0.2);
    border-color: #666666;
    border-width: 0.08;
    border-radius: 0.6;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .back-text {
    font-size: 1.4;
    color: #888888;
  }
</style>
<div class="panel">
  <span class="heading">HOW TO PLAY</span>
  <span class="section">Browser Controls</span>
  <span class="text">WASD / Arrows - Move on court</span>
  <span class="text">Space (hold) - Charge serve</span>
  <span class="text">Space (tap) - Hit ball</span>
  <span class="text">Q - Jump (aerial spikes)</span>
  <span class="text">E - Dive save (extended reach)</span>
  <span class="text">Escape - Pause</span>
  <span class="section">VR Controls</span>
  <span class="text">Left Thumbstick - Move on court</span>
  <span class="text">Right Trigger (hold) - Charge serve</span>
  <span class="text">Right Trigger (tap) - Hit ball</span>
  <span class="text">A Button - Jump</span>
  <span class="text">Right Grip - Dive save</span>
  <span class="text">B Button - Pause</span>
  <span class="section">Game Rules</span>
  <span class="text">Rally point scoring to 21 (win by 2)</span>
  <span class="text">Best of 3 sets in Match mode</span>
  <span class="text">Serve alternates each point</span>
  <span class="section">Hit Types</span>
  <span class="text">High ball near net = SPIKE (powerful)</span>
  <span class="text">Low ball = BUMP (high arc return)</span>
  <span class="text">Medium height = SET (controlled)</span>
  <span class="section">Modes</span>
  <span class="text">Match - Full game (best of 3 sets)</span>
  <span class="text">Quick - Single set to 11</span>
  <span class="text">Rally - Keep the ball alive</span>
  <span class="text">Serve - Practice serving</span>
  <span class="text">Spike - Spike training drills</span>
  <span class="text">Daily - Seeded daily challenge</span>
  <div id="btn-back" class="back-btn"><span class="back-text">BACK</span></div>
</div>
